  "2:1": "And after some days he went into Capernaum again.",
  "2:2": "And people heard that he was in the house. So many gathered that there was no room, not even at the door. And he spoke the word to them.",
  "2:3": "And they came to him, bringing a paralyzed man, carried by four men.",
